          "label": "AI paintings, each from her photograph or her particulars"
        }
      ],
      "help": "Photographs cost nothing; a vessel without an IMO number has none. AI paintings paint each ship once, from her photograph where there is one and from her type, size and flag where there is not, in the style below, at about US$0.04 a painting; needs a fal.ai key."
